message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "DLT Studio: Divisible Load Theory Library"
abstract: >-
  C++20 solver portfolio for Divisible Load Theory (DLT) scheduling, with a
  C-ABI binding for language-agnostic integration. It models the optimal
  distribution of a large, arbitrarily splittable workload across
  heterogeneous networked processors and powers the DLT Portal.
